        "candidate_id": "C_355c0f9d98779b1f_2",
        "edit": "No change: the always block is already edge-triggered on posedge F_IN, so the level-sensitive sensitivity issue from prior observations does not apply. The observed mismatch (Q=...001010 vs expected ...010000 at cycle 27) is a value divergence in the cascade, not a sensitivity-list problem, and no minimal local edit within the frozen scope is identified.",
